kind: llman.sdd.delta
ops[3]{op,req_id,title,statement,from,to,name}:
  add_requirement,tui20,"core-backend-direct","The TUI MUST depend on ratatui-core and ratatui-crossterm directly (NOT the umbrella ratatui crate); the umbrella ratatui dependency MUST be removed from Cargo.toml. Evidence: ratatui-core v0.1.2 contains all types used (Terminal/Frame/Viewport::Inline/insert_before/set_cursor_position/Buffer/Layout/Style/Text/Line/Span/Widget trait) at ratatui/ratatui-core/src/; umbrella init.rs convenience (try_init_with_options/restore/DefaultTerminal) is ~15 lines replicated locally. ratatui-crossterm provides CrosstermBackend (ratatui/ratatui-crossterm/src/lib.rs:160).",null,null,null
  add_requirement,tui21,"no-builtin-widgets","The TUI MUST NOT use any ratatui built-in widget (Paragraph/Block/List/Table/etc.); components MUST be hand-rolled using Line::render (Line implements Widget at ratatui-core/src/text/line.rs:699) or direct Buffer manipulation. Evidence: codex hand-rolls via its own Renderable trait + direct buf.set_string (codex-rs/tui/src/render/renderable.rs:22, bottom_pane/textarea.rs:1928); pi/kimi-code hand-roll all components with no widget toolkit. Built-in widgets target alt-screen full repaint, not inline mutable-tail+scrollback.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,tui22,"scrolling-regions","The TUI MUST enable the ratatui-core scrolling-regions feature (forwarded via ratatui-crossterm) to reduce insert_before flicker; this addresses the c340 §7 known-leftover insert_before jelly effect.",null,null,null
op_scenarios[3]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  tui20,"no-umbrella-dep","Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock are inspected after the change","dependency names are checked","ratatui 0.30.x is absent and ratatui-core + ratatui-crossterm are present"
  tui21,"no-widget-imports","the TUI source under src/app/tui is inspected","import statements are checked","no ratatui::widgets::* or ratatui_core::widgets::* built-in widget type (Paragraph/Block/List/Table) is imported; only Widget/StatefulWidget traits or Line/Text/Span leaf types are used"
  tui22,"flicker-reduced","a long streaming turn with frequent TextDelta newlines is rendered in the TUI","the terminal is observed","insert_before commits do not produce visible clear-and-redraw jelly effect (scrolling-regions engaged)"
